{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19592","headline":"观藏冰 · 张汇","name":"观藏冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒气方穷律，阴精正结冰。\n体坚风带壮，影素月临凝。\n冬赋凌人掌，春期命妇昇。\n凿来壶色彻，纳处镜光澄。\n鲁史曾留问，幽诗旧见称。\n同观里射享，王道颂还兴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张汇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}